From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since24 idle 0x1b, no printk on IRQ skip

since23 logged "skip 0x30 need_*=0" on every REPORT_STATUS 0x1b from
irq/244-synapti (~140us). Level ATTN stayed asserted (payload not
fully consumed and/or IC re-sent 0x1b because HDL never completed).
printk in the handler livelocked dmesg (same class as since14 poll).

since24:
- Log skip 0x30 and HDL helper pending once per boot.
- First 0x1b with need_*=0 sets hdl_status_idle. Later idle 0x1b:
  consume the 2-byte payload if present, return immediately, no
  zeroflash, no helper, no log.
- If ATTN still asserted after that read: one bounded quiet drain
  (cap 8, stop when attn=0 gpio=1). No printk per iteration. Never
  restore do_polling.
- Keep path A: chunked 0x45, no u16 wrap, 0x30 only if need_*, no
  ENABLE_REPORT 0x05 enable path.
- Early "since24 probe"; rate-limit continued_read logs.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-chunk-0x45.patch.

